{"seq":3,"slug":"benefit-stacking-exclusion-conflict","title":"权益叠加、互斥与冲突消解：分层定价与专享体验边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-stacking-exclusion-conflict","wordCount":3058,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"权益叠加-互斥与冲突消解-分层定价与专享体验边界\">权益叠加、互斥与冲突消解：分层定价与专享体验边界</h1><p>两份优惠同时压在同一笔订单上：会员价把单价压低 8%，一张满 300 减 40 的平台券，以及订单已超门槛而生效的免运费权益。若&quot;三者都减&quot;，客单价会被打穿；若只减一个，用户会觉得白买了会员。叠加、互斥与冲突消解回答的正是这一层：<strong>哪些优惠能同时作用于同一笔订单、作用顺序是什么、冲突时谁赢</strong>。上一篇<a href=\"benefit-catalog-taxonomy\">《权益目录分类与建模》</a>确立了&quot;目录不设互斥&quot;的分工，本文把它展开成可判定的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>五个词被混用得最凶，每个都对应不同的判定对象与责任方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>判定对象</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>叠加 Stacking</td>\n<td>多项优惠同时作用于一笔订单</td>\n<td>优惠集合的相容性</td>\n<td>定价/促销引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互斥 Exclusion</td>\n<td>两项优惠不能同时生效</td>\n<td>一组声明式约束</td>\n<td>权益目录（声明方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突消解 Conflict Resolution</td>\n<td>互斥发生时选出最终生效项</td>\n<td>消解策略与优先级</td>\n<td>定价引擎（终裁方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层定价 Tiered Pricing</td>\n<td>价格本身随会员等级变化</td>\n<td>价格构成，非优惠</td>\n<td>定价引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专享体验 Exclusive Access</td>\n<td>改变可及性而非价格</td>\n<td>访问资格（布尔）</td>\n<td>入口层服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>叠加问&quot;能不能一起用&quot;，互斥是&quot;不许一起用&quot;的声明，冲突消解是&quot;不许一起用时听谁的&quot;，分层定价动的是价格本身，专享体验动的是入口。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三个层次-叠加不是一个问题-是三个\">三个层次：叠加不是一个问题，是三个</h2><p>把&quot;能不能叠加&quot;当成一个布尔字段，是这类系统最早塌掉的假设。它实际分布在三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>判定的问题</th>\n<th>判定主体</th>\n<th>冲突后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目录层</td>\n<td>权益项是否声明互斥</td>\n<td>权益目录（静态）</td>\n<td>配置错误，全局生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算层</td>\n<td>这一单能否同时用</td>\n<td>定价引擎（动态）</td>\n<td>单笔算错，用户可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账务层</td>\n<td>金额如何分摊、谁承担</td>\n<td>结算与对账（事后）</td>\n<td>结算错账，财务可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目录层的互斥是<strong>声明式</strong>的：<code>exclusive_group</code>（如 <code>shipping_discount</code>）说&quot;同组内互斥&quot;，便宜可枚举，但不知道门槛、不知道购物车构成。结算层的互斥是<strong>可判定</strong>的：只有拿到完整购物车上下文，才能回答&quot;这张券和这个会员折扣是否命中同一件商品&quot;。账务层的叠加是<strong>分摊</strong>问题：一笔 80 元优惠里多少从平台预算出、多少从卖家结算款扣，取决于 <code>cost_bearer</code> 字段，与用户看到的价格无关。关键结论：<strong>目录层只做粗筛，不做终裁</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[结算请求] --&gt; B[收集可用优惠集]&#10;  B --&gt; C{目录层粗筛&lt;br/&gt;exclusive_group}&#10;  C --&gt;|同组冲突| D[冲突消解]&#10;  C --&gt;|无声明冲突| E[结算层逐项判定&lt;br/&gt;门槛/范围/用量]&#10;  E --&gt;|不满足| F[剔除该项]&#10;  E --&gt;|满足| D&#10;  D --&gt; H{消解策略}&#10;  H --&gt;|best-of| I[取收益最大组合]&#10;  H --&gt;|sequential| J[按优先级依次作用]&#10;  I --&gt; K[定价结果]&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[分摊到行项目&lt;br/&gt;cost_bearer]&#10;  L --&gt; M[写核销流水]\">flowchart TD\n  A[结算请求] --&gt; B[收集可用优惠集]\n  B --&gt; C{目录层粗筛&lt;br/&gt;exclusive_group}\n  C --&gt;|同组冲突| D[冲突消解]\n  C --&gt;|无声明冲突| E[结算层逐项判定&lt;br/&gt;门槛/范围/用量]\n  E --&gt;|不满足| F[剔除该项]\n  E --&gt;|满足| D\n  D --&gt; H{消解策略}\n  H --&gt;|best-of| I[取收益最大组合]\n  H --&gt;|sequential| J[按优先级依次作用]\n  I --&gt; K[定价结果]\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[分摊到行项目&lt;br/&gt;cost_bearer]\n  L --&gt; M[写核销流水]</pre><h2 id=\"冲突消解-apply-all-best-of-与顺序应用\">冲突消解：apply-all、best-of 与顺序应用</h2><p>三种策略不是风格选择，它们产生<strong>不同的可预测性与不同的毛利风险</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>apply-all（全叠加）</strong> 最直觉，也最危险。它假设每项优惠都&quot;边际上可承受&quot;，一旦两个大额券碰面毛利归零。它只在互斥组覆盖足够密时才安全——而&quot;足够密&quot;会随活动增长失效。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序应用（sequential）</strong> 是主流默认做法，它把&quot;叠加&quot;变成有确定顺序的算术链。Shopify 的折扣组合规定固定次序：商品级折扣先作用于行项目，订单级折扣作用于折后小计，运费折扣最后（Shopify Help, <em>Discount combinations</em>）。顺序会改变结果金额——Stripe 文档明确指出&quot;20% 再减 5 美元&quot;与&quot;先减 5 美元再打 20%&quot;是两个不同的数（Stripe, <em>Coupons and promotion codes</em>）。因此<strong>顺序必须进入核销流水的复算字段</strong>。设折前小计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、商品级折扣率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、订单级折扣率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、订单级固定减免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{final}} = \\bigl(S_0 \\cdot (1 - r_p)\\bigr)\\cdot(1 - r_o) - a_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若换成先固定减免再打折，结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bigl(S_0(1-r_p) - a_o\\bigr)(1-r_o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，差额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_o r_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>best-of（取最优）</strong> 面向用户体验：多项优惠互斥时，不随机择一，而是枚举可行组合取收益最大者。Talon.One 的促销评估模型即此思路：按 evaluation group 与 scope 组织判定，item scope 下模式可选&quot;first campaign&quot;或&quot;highest discount value&quot;，且<strong>每件商品只从单个 campaign 获得一次折扣效果</strong>（Talon.One, <em>Campaigns overview</em>）。这条约束让 best-of 从指数枚举降为可解的分组最优问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>用户可预测性</th>\n<th>毛利风险</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>apply-all</td>\n<td>高（所见即所得）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>互斥组覆盖密的封闭活动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sequential</td>\n<td>中（取决于顺序是否公开）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>商品/订单/运费三级折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>best-of</td>\n<td>高（承诺给最优）</td>\n<td>低（有上限）</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>互斥券、会员价与活动券并用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"互斥组-优先级与可判定性\">互斥组、优先级与可判定性</h2><p>冲突消解要可工程化，前提是每条规则都能被判定。三层判定缺一不可：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>范围判定</strong>：优惠是否命中同一件商品。商品级折扣按行项目判定；订单级折扣作用于小计，与商品级不冲突——这正是 Shopify 让两者可组合的结构性原因（Shopify Help, <em>Discount combinations</em>）。</li>\n<li><strong>门槛判定</strong>：满减门槛按折前还是折后小计算？两种口径都合法，但<strong>必须选一种并全局统一</strong>。跨境还要决定用含税价还是不含税价——欧盟展示价含 VAT、美国不含税，同一张&quot;满 $100&quot;券在两地的实际门槛相差一个税率。</li>\n<li><strong>用量判定</strong>：能否同单重复用、单用户累计用几次。Stripe 的 <code>max_redemptions</code> 是全局上限（所有客户共享），&quot;每人一次&quot;要靠 promotion code 的 <code>first_time_transaction</code> 表达（Stripe, <em>Coupons and promotion codes</em>）——<strong>全局上限与单用户上限是两个维度，混用会让活动预算失控</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>优先级解决&quot;两项互斥但都可用时谁先&quot;。推荐把它定义为<strong>序数而非绝对权重</strong>：给权益项一个 <code>priority</code> 整数，数值小者优先；同优先级时才落入 best-of。这样改一条规则不会扰动其他规则的相对次序。另一条约定是<strong>互斥成组、不成对</strong>：用 <code>exclusive_group</code> 表达&quot;这三张运费券只能选一张&quot;，而不是两两写六条互斥关系。成对表达在新增第三项时必然遗漏一条，而遗漏的互斥只在特定购物车组合下暴露——最难复现的一类线上事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层定价的合法边界\">分层定价的合法边界</h2><p>&quot;会员专享价&quot;在跨境场景里不只是定价问题，它受多条规则约束，每条都反过来限制叠加引擎能做什么。</p>\n<p><strong>降价展示的参考价规则。</strong> 欧盟《价格标示指令》第 6a 条（由 Omnibus 指令 2019/2161 引入）规定：商家宣布降价时，必须以<strong>降价前至少 30 天内该商品曾适用的最低价格</strong>作为参考价（EUR-Lex, Directive 98/6/EC consolidated）。这否掉了&quot;把会员价当成促销参考价&quot;的做法——若会员价是常态价，&quot;会员日打 8 折&quot;的参考价不能是虚高吊牌价。对引擎的含义是：<strong>分层价格必须与&quot;临时促销降价&quot;在数据模型上分开存储</strong>，否则参考价会被会员价的频繁变动污染。</p>\n<p><strong>税费与关税的分层。</strong> 跨境订单的价格链是&quot;商品价 + 国际运费 + 关税/VAT&quot;，权益可能作用在其中任意一段。免&quot;国际段运费&quot;与免&quot;全部运费&quot;是不同履约路径（对应目录中两个 atom）；包税权益实际是&quot;代缴关税&quot;这一服务型权益，不是价格减免。定价引擎必须能对价格链<strong>每一段独立应用优惠</strong>，而非只对小计打折。</p>\n<p><strong>订阅型权益的取消便利性。</strong> 会员等级若绑定付费订阅，美国联邦贸易委员会的可疑负选项规则（Negative Option Rule, 16 CFR Part 425）要求在取消上不设不合理障碍；2024 年的 &quot;click-to-cancel&quot; 终版规则同向收紧，2026 年该机构又在法院判决后重新征求意见（FTC, <em>Negative Option Rule</em>）。含义是<strong>降级与退出路径必须与升级路径同等可达</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专享体验的边界-访问型权益不是价格\">专享体验的边界：访问型权益不是价格</h2><p>提前抢购、专享会场、优先发货这类权益不改变价格，改变的是<strong>可及性</strong>，因此互斥语义与折扣完全不同。它们的冲突不是&quot;谁减更多&quot;，而是&quot;给不给这个入口&quot;。判定天然是布尔的，且必须在<strong>入口层</strong>（商品详情页、会场页、库存服务的下单前置校验）完成，而不是结算层。把&quot;提前 2 小时抢购&quot;放到结算时判定就晚了——用户已经在结算页，抢购窗口早已过去。</p>\n<p>两条边界必须显式声明：<strong>访问权不消耗余额，但必须有明确结束条件</strong>——折扣券核销后余额减一，访问权是&quot;窗口期内一直有效&quot;的状态，需要一个与权益有效期解耦的<strong>窗口</strong>字段，否则活动结束后用户仍能进入会场；<strong>访问权与折扣权的组合要防&quot;隐性叠加&quot;</strong>——专享会场同时挂会员折扣和会场券时，&quot;能否叠加&quot;必须在会场配置里显式声明，而不是落到结算层临时决定，因为会场的营销意图只有运营知道。</p>\n<p>访问型权益在目录里用 <code>applicable_scope</code> 表达生效范围、用互斥组表达&quot;两个会场只能进一个&quot;，与费率型权益共用同一套互斥原语，但<strong>不共用判定时机</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可复算-一次核销必须能重放\">可复算：一次核销必须能重放</h2><p>冲突消解最容易被忽视的验收标准是<strong>可复算</strong>：给定一条核销流水，系统能否在不依赖当时内存状态的前提下重算出同一个结果。做不到时的典型症状是：用户投诉&quot;为什么这单只减了 40 而不是 80&quot;，客服翻遍日志也说不清当时哪几项优惠生效。要让它可复算，核销流水必须携带：生效权益项的 <strong>code 与 version</strong>、购物车快照摘要、<strong>应用的顺序</strong>、每项的实际贡献金额，以及被<strong>排除</strong>的候选与排除原因——最后一项常被忽略，却恰是冲突消解唯一的调试线索。对应约定是判定函数必须<strong>纯函数</strong>化：输入（购物车快照, 权益账本快照, 目录版本），输出（定价结果, 分摊明细, 排除说明），时间/随机/汇率在函数外注入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>叠加分三层</strong>：目录层粗筛、结算层终判、账务层分摊。目录不做终裁。</li>\n<li><strong>三种消解策略各有取舍</strong>：apply-all 可预测但毛利风险高；sequential 是主流默认但顺序会改变金额，必须入账；best-of 靠&quot;每件商品一次效果&quot;约束把枚举降为可解问题。</li>\n<li><strong>互斥成组、优先级用序数</strong>：成对互斥会在新增第三项时静默出错。</li>\n<li><strong>门槛口径必须全局统一</strong>：折前/折后、含税/不含税，同一张券在两地的实际门槛可能相差一个税率。</li>\n<li><strong>分层定价受合规约束</strong>：欧盟降价展示的 30 天参考价规则要求分层价格与临时促销价分开存储。</li>\n<li><strong>访问型权益判定在入口层、非结算层</strong>，需要独立于有效期的窗口字段。</li>\n<li><strong>可复算是验收标准</strong>：核销流水带 code+version、顺序、贡献额、排除原因；判定函数必须是纯函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>参考来源</strong>：Shopify Help <em>Discount combinations</em>（商品→订单→运费的应用顺序）；Stripe <em>Coupons and promotion codes</em>（顺序影响金额、<code>max_redemptions</code> 与 promotion code 限制）；Talon.One <em>Campaigns overview</em>（evaluation group/scope、&quot;highest discount value&quot;、每件商品单次折扣效果）；EUR-Lex <em>Directive 98/6/EC consolidated, Art. 6a</em>（降价展示的 30 天最低参考价）；FTC <em>Negative Option Rule</em>（16 CFR Part 425）。费率与法规条文随年份及司法辖区变动，落地前须以当年官方原文复核。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权益叠加、互斥与冲突消解：分层定价与专享体验边界","id":"权益叠加-互斥与冲突消解-分层定价与专享体验边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个层次：叠加不是一个问题，是三个","id":"三个层次-叠加不是一个问题-是三个"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突消解：apply-all、best-of 与顺序应用","id":"冲突消解-apply-all-best-of-与顺序应用"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥组、优先级与可判定性","id":"互斥组-优先级与可判定性"},{"level":2,"text":"分层定价的合法边界","id":"分层定价的合法边界"},{"level":2,"text":"专享体验的边界：访问型权益不是价格","id":"专享体验的边界-访问型权益不是价格"},{"level":2,"text":"可复算：一次核销必须能重放","id":"可复算-一次核销必须能重放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"权益资格规则引擎：人群定向、条件判定与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-eligibility-rule-engine"},"next":{"title":"券发行、会员钱包与权益账本：发放、余额与对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/benefit-redemption-fulfillment/voucher-issuance-wallet-ledger"}}